    "name": "SubLedger",
    "description": "Walks through the whole SubLedger workflow and checks every business rule. Run the folders in order (or use the Collection Runner). Ids are passed between requests through collection variables, and a fresh customer email is generated on every run, so the collection can be re-run against the same database.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
